MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 687018787}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6f9c0723c1c63d45bda37a3070a57a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  searchType: 0
  unitID: 
  hasDialogue: 0
  chatBoxPrefab: {fileID: 2020387750}
  optionBoxPrefab: {fileID: 475889443}
  dialogue:
    name: Atty
    sentences:
    - 'Hello stranger! My name is Atty! Wecome to the fire planet krogath! I hear
      you''re an up and coming restaurant owner! I used to be one myself, so I can
      take you through the basics! '
    - As a chef, you can chop, mix, and bake ingredients. This world has a bunch
      of ingredients you can forage for and store, so be sure to explore!
    - Customers will sometimes come to your establishment with orders/quests, so
      try to feed every hungry mouth!
    - Let's practice with a simple one. For now, how about trying to get me a banana?
    quest_check:
    - Hey again! Oh! It looks like you've found a banana!
    - The system will tell you a quest is complete after I'm done talking. But for
      actual customers, you can't just give them ingredients, you have to cook!
    - To do that, you first have to put items in the fridge for prepping! After that
      you can use one of the other three stations to cook them!
    - Go to the red dot on your minimap to find your workspace! Have fun!
    quest_complete:
    - 'Hey again! '
    - How's the restaurant business going?
    - Your fridge has a lot of space while your inventory doesn't, so be sure to
      store all your ingredients in there ASAP!
    - The process might be confusing at first, but keep at it!
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
