--- !u!114 &1625241884
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1625241881}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6f9c0723c1c63d45bda37a3070a57a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  searchType: 0
  unitID: 
  hasDialogue: 0
  chatBoxPrefab: {fileID: 2020387750}
  optionBoxPrefab: {fileID: 475889443}
  dialogue:
    name: Monke
    sentences:
    - Ah there you are! I've been searching for you! I'm Monke, I'm your investor!
    - 'You don''t know how to cook! Oh well that''s okay! I can teach you! '
    - 'You see the rightmost appliance is the fridge. You use that for storing and
      prepping all the ingredients you find in krogath! If you cant add an ingredient,
      that most likely means that its actually a meal. '
    - 'The sink is for chopping! Only ingredients like apples can be used on that
      station. You can make a salad with that station. '
    - 'The oven is for baking! Only ingredients like bananas can be used for that
      station. You can make ice cream with that station. '
    - 'This concludes our crash course! Try and make some meals to get the hang of
      it! '
    - The leftmost station is for mixing! Only ingredients like cinderwheat can be
      used there. You can make croissants with that station.
    - Lastly, if you see any red dots on your minimap, it means a customer is approaching!
      Remember to swiftly take their order!
    - Oh and I have a twin also named monke that lives around here. Last I heard
      he was lost somewhere in the lava lake, but if you find him, bring him a banana
      please. He hasn't eaten in days....
    quest_check:
